  dialogueText: 'If you are in trouble or need assistance, you need a direct way
    to ask for help.

    In Ilokano, ''tulunganak'' means ''help me.''

    Use
    it when you urgently need someone to assist you.

    Now, try saying ''tulongannak''
    yourself.'
